---

This project talks to an undocumented Anthropic endpoint
(`/api/oauth/usage`) discovered by reading the public `@anthropic-ai/claude-code`
CLI's own bundled source. It is not an official Anthropic tool, is not
endorsed by Anthropic, and may break without notice on any Claude Code
update. See README.md, "How this works and its risks."
